.TH CHM-RETRO-LAUNCH 1
.SH NAME
chm-retro-launch \- launch Amiga 500/2000 or Commodore 64 emulator profiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B retro/commodore/launch-machine.sh
.I MACHINE DISK_IMAGE
.SH MACHINES
.TP
.B amiga-a500
Launch an Amiga 500 profile using FS-UAE or RetroArch/PUAE.
.TP
.B amiga-a2000
Launch an Amiga 2000 profile using FS-UAE or RetroArch/PUAE.
.TP
.B commodore-c64
Launch a Commodore 64 disk using VICE x64sc/x64 or MAME.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CHIMERA_KICKSTART_ROM
Optional user-provided Kickstart ROM. PUAE can use its built-in AROS replacement if unset.
.TP
.B CHIMERA_PUAE_CORE
Optional path to puae_libretro.so.
.SH NOTES
Generated ADFs are formatted data disks, not a bundled Workbench. Commercial firmware and media are not redistributed.
